                "id": "CF-3091900D0O000000rwimUAA",
                "title": "Network Services",
                "description": "This is a Contract Award Notice.\r\n\r\nThe Care Quality Commission (CQC) requires the services of a Network Services Delivery Partner to deliver ongoing support to ensure the continuation of connectivity services (wide area network, local area network and Wi-Fi services) to CQC offices.\r\n\r\nThis procurement was undertaken through the CCS framework RM6116 Network Services 3, Lot 1a Inter site Connectivity (Wide Area Network) / Data Access Services and Lot2a\r\nIntra site Connectivity (Local Area Network) / Local Connectivity Services following the direct award process.\r\n\r\nThe Contract is awarded for a total period of 24 months.\r\n\r\nTotal Awarded Value is maximum of all charges including any optional contract extensions.\r\n\r\nContract Reference: CQC I&D 143",
